      "source": "Copyright © 2005 - <script>var d = new Date();\n        document.write(d.getFullYear());</script> Broadcom. All Rights Reserved. The term \"Broadcom\" refers to Broadcom Inc. and/or its subsidiaries.<br/><a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/legal.html\">Terms of Use</a> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Privacy</a> • <a href=\"https://spring.io/trademarks\">Trademark Guidelines</a> <span id=\"thank-you-mobile\">• <a href=\"https://spring.io/thank-you\">Thank you</a></span> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy/california-privacy-rights.html\">Your California Privacy Rights</a> • <a class=\"ot-sdk-show-settings\">Cookie Settings</a> <span id=\"teconsent\"></span>",
      "translation": "版权所有 © 2005 - <script>var d = new Date(); document.write(d.getFullYear());</script> Broadcom。保留所有权利。“Broadcom”指 Broadcom Inc. 及其/或其子公司。<br/><a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/legal.html\">使用条款</a> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">隐私政策</a> • <a href=\"https://spring.io/trademarks\">商标指南</a> <span id=\"thank-you-mobile\">• <a href=\"https://spring.io/thank-you\">致谢</a></span> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy/california-privacy-rights.html\">您的加州隐私权利</a> • <a class=\"ot-sdk-show-settings\">Cookie 设置</a> <span id=\"teconsent\"></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "As you can see there are two special fields in there: The <code>__internalNeo4jId__</code> and the <code>__nodeLabels__</code>.\nBoth are critical when it comes to mapping the data to Java objects.\nThe value of the <code>__internalNeo4jId__</code> is either <code>id(n)</code> or the provided custom id but in the mapping process one known field to refer to has to exist.\nThe <code>__nodeLabels__</code> ensures that all defined labels on this node can be found and mapped.\nThis is needed for situations when inheritance is used and you query not for the concrete classes or have relationships defined that only define a super-type.",
      "translation": "如您所见，这里有两个特殊字段：`__internalNeo4jId__` 和 `__nodeLabels__`。  \n在将数据映射到 Java 对象时，这两个字段都至关重要。  \n`__internalNeo4jId__` 的值要么是 `id(n)`，要么是您提供的自定义 ID，但在映射过程中必须存在一个已知的引用字段。  \n`__nodeLabels__` 确保可以找到并映射该节点上定义的所有标签。  \n这在涉及继承的情况中是必需的，例如当您查询的不是具体类，或者定义了仅指定超类型的关系时。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Beside the <code>find/load</code> operations the <code>save</code> operation is one of the most used when working with data.\nA save operation call in general issues multiple statements against the database to ensure that the resulting graph model matches the given Java model.",
      "translation": "在 `<code>find/load</code>` 操作之外，`<code>save</code>` 操作是处理数据时最常用的操作之一。  \n一般而言，调用保存操作会向数据库发出多个语句，以确保生成的图模型与给定的 Java 模型相匹配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For the next defined relationship on the root entity start with 2. but replace <em>first</em> with <em>next</em>.",
      "translation": "对于根实体上的下一个定义的关系，从 2 开始，但将<em>first</em>替换为<em>next</em>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>save</code> operation is overloaded with the functionality for accepting multiple entities of the same type.\nIf you are working with generated id values or make use of optimistic locking, every entity will result in a separate <code>CREATE</code> call.",
      "translation": "`save` 操作已重载，支持接受同一类型的多个实体。  \n如果您使用的是生成的 ID 值或使用了乐观锁机制，每个实体都会触发一个独立的 `CREATE` 调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>load</code> documentation will not only show you how the <em>MATCH</em> part of the query looks like but also how the data gets returned.",
      "translation": "`load` 文档不仅会展示查询中 `<em>MATCH</em>` 部分的外观，还会显示数据的返回方式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the entity is <strong>not</strong> new all relationships of the first found type at the domain model will get removed from the database.",
      "translation": "如果该实体并非<strong>新</strong>的，则域模型中所有首次发现类型的关系都将从数据库中删除。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In other cases SDN will create a parameter list with the entity information and provide it with a <code>MERGE</code> call.",
      "translation": "在其他情况下，SDN 将创建一个包含实体信息的参数列表，并通过 `<code>MERGE</code>` 调用提供该列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The simplest kind of load operation is a <code>findById</code> call.\nIt will match all nodes with the label of the type you queried for and does a filter on the id value.",
      "translation": "最简单的加载操作是调用 `<code>findById</code>`。它会匹配所有具有您查询类型的标签的节点，并根据 id 值进行过滤。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The data to return is defined as a <a href=\"https://neo4j.com/docs/cypher-manual/current/syntax/maps/#cypher-map-projection\">map projection</a>.",
      "translation": "返回的数据定义为<a href=\"https://neo4j.com/docs/cypher-manual/current/syntax/maps/#cypher-map-projection\">映射投影</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Talking about relationships: If you have defined relationships in your entity, they will get added to the returned map as <a href=\"https://neo4j.com/docs/cypher-manual/4.0/syntax/lists/#cypher-pattern-comprehension\">pattern comprehensions</a>.\nThe above return part will then look like:",
      "translation": "关于关系：如果您在实体中定义了关系，它们将以<a href=\"https://neo4j.com/docs/cypher-manual/4.0/syntax/lists/#cypher-pattern-comprehension\">模式推导</a>的形式添加到返回的映射中。  \n上述 RETURN 子句将如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This chapter is about the technical creation of queries when using SDN’s abstraction layers.\nThere will be some simplifications because we do not discuss every possible case but stick with the general idea behind it.",
      "translation": "本章介绍在使用 SDN 抽象层时查询的技术构建方法。由于我们不讨论所有可能的情况，而是专注于其背后的基本理念，因此会对内容进行一些简化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A union statement will get created that either creates a node, if the node’s identifier cannot be found, or updates the node’s property if the node itself exists.",
      "translation": "将创建一个联合语句，该语句会在找不到节点标识符时创建新节点，或在节点已存在时更新其属性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The related entity will get created in the same way as the root entity.",
      "translation": "相关实体将以与根实体相同的方式创建。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The relationship itself will get created",
      "translation": "关系本身将会被创建。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the related entity also has relationships to other entities, the same procedure as in 2. will get started.",
      "translation": "如果相关实体与其他实体也存在关联关系，则同样启动第 2 节所述的操作流程。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "and the parameters look like",
      "translation": "而参数看起来如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If there is a custom id provided SDN will use the property you have defined as the id.",
      "translation": "如果提供了自定义 ID，SDN 将使用您定义的属性作为标识符。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The map projection and pattern comprehension used by SDN ensures that only the properties and relationships you have defined are getting queried.",
      "translation": "SDN 使用的地图投影和模式理解机制确保仅查询您定义的属性和关系。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In cases where you have self-referencing nodes or creating schemas that potentially lead to cycles in the data that gets returned,\nSDN falls back to a cascading / data-driven query creation.\nStarting with an initial query that looks for the specific node and considering the conditions,\nit steps through the resulting nodes and, if their relationships are also mapped, would create further queries on the fly.\nThis query creation and execution loop will continue until no query finds new relationships or nodes.\nThe way of the creation can be seen analogue to the save/update process.",
      "translation": "在存在自引用节点，或创建可能导致返回数据中出现循环的架构时，SDN 会退化为级联/数据驱动的查询生成方式。  \n从最初查找特定节点的查询开始，并结合相关条件，它会遍历生成的节点；如果这些节点的关系也已映射，则会动态创建进一步的查询。  \n该查询生成与执行的循环将持续进行，直到没有任何查询能发现新的关系或节点为止。  \n这种生成方式可类比为保存/更新过程。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
